WEBVTT

00:06:26.528 --> 00:06:30.591
For me, that solidified my passion
to embrace those tears.

00:06:31.639 --> 00:06:33.591
Then, it got better.

00:06:34.242 --> 00:06:37.567
On the last night
of that same six-week class,

00:06:37.591 --> 00:06:40.170
one of the expecting moms came up to me.

00:06:40.694 --> 00:06:43.321
She asked to talk to me privately,
and I said of course,

00:06:43.345 --> 00:06:45.075
and we went into the corner.

00:06:45.099 --> 00:06:46.249
And she says,

00:06:46.273 --> 00:06:49.388
"I need to thank you
for saving my relationship."

00:06:51.095 --> 00:06:52.960
I let her go on, and she tells me

00:06:52.984 --> 00:06:55.840
that her husband
was considering leaving her

00:06:55.864 --> 00:06:57.499
over her mood swings,

00:06:57.523 --> 00:06:59.101
out-of-control crying,

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:02.025
and his turmoil and anger
over this pregnancy.